# Extradition procedures define the time limit for submitting a transit request following an unscheduled landing.

```catala
declaration scope ExtraditionTransitScope:
  input unscheduled_landing_date content date
  input request_receipt_date content date
  output is_timely_transit_request content boolean
```

The request for transit must be received within 96 hours of the unscheduled landing.

```catala
scope ExtraditionTransitScope:
  date round down
  definition is_timely_transit_request equals
    (request_receipt_date - unscheduled_landing_date) <= 4 day
```